{
  "title": "Zesty Earthy Spanish Walnuts Fabada Asturiana",
  "description": "A hearty and earthy Spanish stew featuring walnuts and kombu cold extract, this dish is a crowd-pleaser and jain-friendly. It is a variation of the traditional Fabada Asturiana from Catalonia.",
