  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soaked and drained fabes beans, smoked paprika, salt, black pepper, and bay leaves to the pot.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer the stew for 1 hour.",
    "Add the chopped walnuts and kombu cold extract to the pot and stir to combine.",
    "Continue to simmer the stew for an additional 30 minutes.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with additional chopped walnuts if desired."
  ],
